  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### Changed\n\n- [Fewer progress notifications](https://github.com/ionide/FsAutoComplete/pull/1545) - Typechecks share one \"Typechecking\" progress report, instead of one report per file. Its message lists the files being checked and, after a save, how many of the dependent files are done, with a percentage. Cancelling the report stops the checks of the dependent files that did not run yet. With `backgroundServiceProgress` on, the analyzers of a file share one \"Analyzing\" report the same way. (thanks @TheAngryByrd!)",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
